{"id":"bordel","lemma":"bordel","pos":"noun","rank":558,"glosses":["brothel","bloody mess (UK), goddamn mess (US)"],"ipa":"/bɔʁ.dɛl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/11/Fr-bordel.ogg/Fr-bordel.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bordels"},"formAudio":{"bordels":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-bordels.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Regarde ce bordel.","en":"Look at this mess.","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"this / it"},null]},{"text":"Sa chambre est un bordel.","en":"His room's a mess.","words":[{"g":"his"},{"g":"a room."},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ma vie est un tel bordel !","en":"My life is such a mess.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"so-and-so"]]},{"text":"C'était le bordel.","en":"It was a mess.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Désolé pour le bordel !","en":"Sorry about the mess.","words":[{"g":"sorry"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}